haracter from 2D to 3D in this unique VR experience!\n* 5 breathtaking worlds to explore in 360\u00b0: from prehistorical forest to the future city and even Mars!\n* Innovative hidden object mechanics: try to catch Om Nom and tame him by feeding candies, then find all objects on the level to fix the portal and return home.\n* Randomly generated tasks in changing environment: try to spot 3D objects under different perspectives, find Om Nom in the darkness and use your hi-tech flashlight to see through things on the level.\n* Cuteness overload: watch Om Nom\u2019s adorable reactions to your actions and surrounding locations!\nPlease note: Gear VR Controller is required to play the game.\n\nIn case of problems write to support@zeptolab.com", "short_description": "Follow Om Nom into the unknown, explore gorgeous 3D environments and try to find the cute green creature from the world-famous Cut the Rope games."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.cuttherope.net/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.cuttherope.net/terms", "publisher_name": "ZeptoLab UK Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zeptolab.com/contact/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "313914954033858"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162718_345757019187972_5897521152934281216_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&cc